Third-party code
----------------
src/biex.js implements FlowJo's biexponential transform following FlowKit's
generate_biex_lut (https://github.com/whitews/FlowKit, BSD 3-Clause License,
Copyright (c) 2018, Scott White), which states it was ported from cytolib
(https://github.com/RGLab/cytolib, AGPL-3.0-only, Copyright 2019 Fred
Hutchinson Cancer Research Center), whose code notes it was translated from a
Java routine from Tree Star (FlowJo's original developer).
